<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89639" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσ-κοπή</span></b>  (B), ἡ,=
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσκομμα</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>offence taken</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθόνος καὶ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.7.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. καὶ μύσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					30.29.7
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα ἀλλοτριότης καὶ
			π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				31.10.4
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.Herc.</u>
				994.38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				31.17
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοσήματα κατὰ προσκοπὴν
			γινόμενα</span>, i.e. antipathies, <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				3.102
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσκοπῆς ἄξιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					1.195
				</span></i>
			: but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδεμίαν π. διδόναι</span>
			give no <i>cause of offence</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
				6.3
			</span></i>.</div>
